{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000008", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_p003", "type": "tool_result", "content": "bin/deploy.sh: dist/releasekit.tar.gz is missing\nmake: *** [deploy] Error 2"}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000009", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:01:34.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000009", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0010", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Second gate: exit 2 until `make build` has written the bundle. So the CI job needs both."}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000010", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:01:40.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000010", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0011", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_p004", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "make build && DEPLOY_ENV=staging-blue make deploy", "description": "Build then deploy"}}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000011", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:02:02.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000011", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_p004", "type": "tool_result", "content": "wrote dist/releasekit.tar.gz\ndeployed to staging-blue\n"}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000012", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:02:04.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000012", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0013", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "That is the fix: CI has to run `make build` first and set `DEPLOY_ENV` to a target the runbook lists. Two separate exit codes, 2 and 3, and neither is documented anywhere in the repository."}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000013", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:02:12.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000013", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Good. That's exactly the kind of thing I keep rediscovering \u2014 the two exit codes and what each one means."}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000014", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:03:00.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000014", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0015", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Noted. While I was in `bin/deploy.sh` I saw something else worth raising."}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000015", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:03:10.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000015", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0016", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_p005", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "grep -n RETRY_BUDGET bin/deploy.sh", "description": "Check the retry budget"}}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000016", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:03:14.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000016", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_p005", "type": "tool_result", "content": "8:RETRY_BUDGET=${RETRY_BUDGET:-3}\n24:    while [ \"$attempt\" -lt \"$RETRY_BUDGET\" ]; do"}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000017", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:03:16.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000017", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0018", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`RETRY_BUDGET` defaults to 3. I think it should be 10, and here is the argument.\n\nThe staging load balancer takes up to 40 seconds to drain a node. Three attempts at a 5-second backoff gives up after 15 seconds, well inside the drain window, so a deploy that would have succeeded is reported as a failure. At 10 attempts the last retry lands at 50 seconds, past the worst observed drain. The cost of the change is a slower failure on a genuinely broken deploy \u2014 50 seconds instead of 15 \u2014 which is not a number anyone watches.\n\nI would set `RETRY_BUDGET=10` as the new default in `bin/deploy.sh:8`. Want me to?"}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000018", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:03:30.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000018", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0019", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "One caveat before you answer: raising it also raises the ceiling on a wedged deploy holding the CI runner, so if the runner has its own timeout under 50 seconds this trades one failure mode for another. I have not checked what that timeout is."}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000019", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:03:44.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000019", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Hold on \u2014 what does `make test` actually cover today? I want to know before we touch anything in deploy.sh."}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000020", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:05:00.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000020", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0021", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_p006", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "cat Makefile", "description": "Read the test target"}}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000021", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:05:08.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000021", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_p006", "type": "tool_result", "content": "test:\n\tsh bin/test.sh\n\nbuild:\n\tsh bin/build.sh\n\ndeploy:\n\tsh bin/deploy.sh\n"}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000022", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:05:10.000Z"}
