{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000023", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_p007", "type": "tool_result", "content": "ok   greet defaults to world\nok   greet takes a name\nok   parser strips comments\n"}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000024", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:05:16.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000024", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0025", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`make test` is two smoke checks: three assertions over `bin/greet.sh` and the vendored parser. It never touches `bin/deploy.sh`, so nothing in the suite would catch a retry regression."}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000025", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:05:30.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000025", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Right. Leave deploy.sh alone then and let's get the CI job fixed instead."}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000026", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:07:00.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000026", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0027", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Understood \u2014 `bin/deploy.sh` untouched. The CI job needs `make build` before `make deploy` and `DEPLOY_ENV=staging-blue` in its environment."}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000027", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:07:12.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000027", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_0028", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_p008", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "make test", "description": "Confirm the suite is still green"}}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000028", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:07:30.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000028", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "PROJECT_CWD", "sessionId": "SESSION_ID", "version": "2.1.229", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_p008", "type": "tool_result", "content": "ok\n"}]}, "uuid": "f0000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000029", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:07:32.000Z"}
