{"type": "assistant", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T10:08:20.000Z", "message": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "One thing I want to put back on the table before we close: `RETRY_BUDGET` at 3. I checked the runner timeout this time \u2014 `ops/runbook-417.txt` does not set one, and the CI job inherits the default 15 minutes, so the caveat I raised earlier does not apply here. Ten attempts at a 5-second backoff finishes at 50 seconds, past the worst drain we have seen, and a wedged deploy still exits long before the runner gives up. I think 10 is the right value."}]}}
